+- Resolved (f967b64): `Tile` gained `Trap(TrapKind)` with the six kinds
+  (arrow, dart, falling item, teleport, sleep gas, acid pool); traps
+  disarm on trigger. Doors now block (`is_walkable` excludes both door
+  states); bumping a closed door opens it (costs the turn) and a locked
+  door consumes an iron key. Water/lava/spore-gas are enterable but apply
+  slow/damage/poison per turn via `apply_tile_effects`. Generation places
+  1–5 corridor doors (20% locked, key dropped; each validated so the
+  stairs stay reachable with every door closed, plus a `repair_doors`
+  backstop), traps on all depths, and depth-themed hazards (spore gas
+  D6-10, water D11-15, lava D16-20). D2 carves a 6×5 shop room and D15 a
+  9×6 boss arena, each walled with a closed door at the corridor mouth
+  (`Level.shop_room` / `Level.boss_arena` record the door tile as the seam
+  for issues 16 and 19). 124 tests pass.
